[{"type": "chat", "time": 5227.784, "timestamp": "01:27:07", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "!remindjoq hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5254.39, "timestamp": "01:27:34", "text": "或者任何其他提醒，我也有提醒系統。你可以在 YouTube 的「踢」和 Twitch 的「感嘆號」空白鍵中輸入它。您需要輸入訊息，它會顯示在這裡。  是啊，太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5258.31, "timestamp": "01:27:38", "text": "例如，現在提醒 Jock 你好。如果我輸入“joello hello”，它應該會"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5265.454, "timestamp": "01:27:45", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "!remindjoq holy tech god"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5267.99, "timestamp": "01:27:47", "text": "顯示在這裡。如果不是，那就是我忘了，然後它壞了。但是如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5274.229, "timestamp": "01:27:54", "text": "輸入“你好，幸運兒，也歡迎你，夥計”，或者“你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5277.11, "timestamp": "01:27:57", "text": "你好，我做得很好”。所以如果我那樣做，是的，它奏效了。  請查看 YouTube 聊天提醒，它會在 Discord 伺服器上顯示。是的，同樣的道理也適用於Twitch。"}]